# Build outputs
target/
target-ide/

# Where Quinoa unpacks its own node when the image build asks it to (docker/Dockerfile passes
# -Dquarkus.quinoa.package-manager-install=true). Never present on a machine that has node of its
# own, which is exactly why it is easy to commit by accident from one that does not.
.quinoa/

